# [[.Name]]

Go HTTP API with a key-value store. Generated by kickhub from `[[.Template]]` v[[.Version]], target **[[.Target]]**.

## Layout

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `cmd/api` | HTTP server: `GET /healthz`, `GET /items/{id}`, `PUT /items/{id}` |
| `internal/store/store.go` | Storage interface the handlers depend on |
| `internal/store/provider.go` | The only target-specific code: the storage adapter |
[[ if eq .Target "local" -]]
| `docker-compose.yml` | DynamoDB Local, table bootstrap and the API |
[[- else -]]
| `infra/` | Terraform for every cloud resource this component needs |
[[- end ]]
| `.kickhub.yaml` | Records the template, version and parameters used |

## Run it
[[ if eq .Target "local" ]]
```sh
make up      # builds the image, starts DynamoDB Local, creates the table
make smoke   # writes and reads one item
make down
```
[[ else if eq .Target "aws" ]]
```sh
make test
make infra-apply                      # creates the table, ECR repo and roles
aws ecr get-login-password --region [[.P.aws_region]] | docker login --username AWS --password-stdin "$(terraform -chdir=infra output -raw ecr_repository_url | cut -d/ -f1)"
make image REPO="$(terraform -chdir=infra output -raw ecr_repository_url)"
make infra-apply IMAGE_URI="$(terraform -chdir=infra output -raw ecr_repository_url):$(git rev-parse --short HEAD)"
terraform -chdir=infra output service_url
```

The first `infra-apply` runs without an image and skips App Runner; the second one creates the service.
[[ else ]]
```sh
make test
make infra-apply                      # enables APIs, creates Firestore, the registry and the service account
gcloud auth configure-docker [[.P.gcp_region]]-docker.pkg.dev
make image REPO="$(terraform -chdir=infra output -raw image_repository)"
make infra-apply IMAGE_URI="$(terraform -chdir=infra output -raw image_repository):$(git rev-parse --short HEAD)"
terraform -chdir=infra output service_url
```

The first `infra-apply` runs without an image and skips Cloud Run; the second one creates the service.
[[ end ]]
## Before production

- Add authentication in front of the API; it is open by default.
[[ if ne .Target "local" ]]- Move Terraform state to a remote backend.
[[ end ]]- Keep secrets out of the repo; `.env` is git-ignored.
- Commit `go.sum` after the first `make tidy`.
